{"minVersion":"0.1","headerImage":"https://qnblackcat.github.io/MyOwnRepo/assets/ai.paisseon.cccalc/banner.png","tintColor":"","tabs":[{"tabname":"Details","views":[{"class":"HiddenDepictionScreenshotsView","screenshots":[],"itemCornerRadius":8,"itemSize":false},{"markdown":"Turn the Calculator CC module into a working calculator","useSpacing":"true","class":"DepictionMarkdownView"},{"class":"DepictionSpacerView"},{"class":"DepictionHeaderView","title":"Information"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"Developer","text":"gilesgc & paisseon"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"Version","text":"2.1.0"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"Compatibility","text":"iOS 15.0 to 17.0"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"Section","text":"Tweaks"},{"class":"DepictionSpacerView"},{"class":"DepictionTableButtonView","title":"View Source Code","action":"https://github.com/qnblackcat/CCCalc","openExternal":"true","tintColor":""},{"class":"DepictionSpacerView"},{"class":"DepictionTableButtonView","title":"Contact Support","action":"depiction-https://qnblackcat.github.io/MyOwnRepo/depiction/native/help/ai.paisseon.cccalc.json","openExternal":"true","tintColor":""},{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"Silica 1.2.2 \u2013 Updated 2026-10-10","textColor":"#999999","fontSize":"10.0","alignment":1}],"class":"DepictionStackView"},{"tabname":"Changelog","views":[{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"#### Version 2.1.0\n\n- Roothide build.\n- Two-line display: the full expression (e.g. `2\u00d7(1+3)`) sits above the result, with long expressions scrolling to keep what you're typing visible.\n- Proper order of operations with parentheses; `2(` means `2\u00d7(` and `200+10%` means 10% of 200, like the stock Calculator.\n- Tapping `=` again repeats the last operation.\n- New result history: tap an entry to copy it.\n- Taller module with an extra row of buttons; very large or small results switch to scientific notation."},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","m